# PatchifiedMask

`PatchifiedMask` = `PatchifiedMaskSpec` + batched `torch.Tensor`. Spec is `PatchLayout` × `patch_size` × `MaskPolarity`. No `original_channels`. Binary, floating `{0, 1}`, constant on non-overlapping `P×P` patches. Polarity is a claim.

| Layout | Payload |
|---|---|
| `SPATIAL` | `(B, Y_dim, X_dim)` |
| `PATCH_GRID` | `(B, Y_patches, X_patches)` |
| `SEQUENCE` | `(B, Y_patches·X_patches)` |

- Tensor: `PatchifiedMask.from_tensor(tensor=..., spec=...)`. Spatial `(B, 1, Y_dim, X_dim)` squeezes. Not a fourth layout.
- Convert: layout maps as PatchifiedTensor; polarity flip is `1 - mask`. Same `P`.
- `SEQUENCE` → grid: `unflatten(Y_patches=..., X_patches=...)` → `PATCH_GRID`.

```python
mask = PatchifiedMask.from_tensor(tensor=spatial, spec=spatial_spec)
tokens = mask.convert(spec=sequence_spec)
grid = tokens.unflatten(Y_patches=y_patches, X_patches=x_patches)
visible = mask.convert(spec=visible_spec)
```
